    aiAssistedSkillsMetrics: initializeAIAssistedSkillsMetrics(), // Digital AI augmentation (GitHub Copilot, ChatGPT, AI tutors)

    // TIER 4.6: Labor-Capital Distribution (Phase 4: Productivity-Wage Decoupling)
