 * - Pew Political Typology (2021-2024)
 * - Elite-mass gap: 30-40% variance in AI trust
 * - Crisis vulnerability: Elites 4x less exposed than masses
 * - Survival rates: Elites 1.5x, precariat 0.5x baseline
